<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAD, Sweden 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Swedish</p>
<p>Open men's tennis tournament final on Sunday:</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
